The payload is tied to the entropy first-variation payload. It records a
controlled time interval, an entropy value along that interval, and a
nonnegative dissipation certificate making the entropy value monotone up to
the first-variation defect.
-/
structure PerelmanEntropyMonotonicityPayload
    {n : ℕ∞ω}
    {M : Type u} [TopologicalSpace M] [ChartedSpace ThreeManifoldModel M]
    [IsManifold ThreeManifoldModelWithCorners 1 M]
