scale and envelope for the theorem-level statement, a domain of regions covered
by canonical neighborhoods, the assignment of each region to a classified
neck/cap model, and equality contracts showing that the theorem-level labels
and scales retain the classification data.
-/
structure CanonicalNeighborhoodTheoremPayload
