Concrete payload for regularity of the min-max surface.

The payload records the regularity parameter selected from the stationary
min-max data, the slice it represents, a point witnessing that this slice is
nonempty, a local parameter neighborhood for the regularity certificate, and
the inherited stationarity/width controls.
